   ◆ Ada's past: He has been known to boast that he would never spend a penny that he had not honestly earned.
   ◆ Arthur's past: He was always particular to be punctual, and always made a point of finishing his task at the close of the day.
   ◆ Mr. Thomas's past: He was always punctual to a minute, and never kept a creditor waiting for a shilling.
